"""
Connectors of `Machinery.OnOffConsumer`, without any equation. Kept for name stability:
since Dyad 3.5 a parameter preset extends `OnOffConsumer` itself and inherits its ports.
"""
partial component OnOffConsumerPorts
  "On/off command: 1 = on, 0 = off"
  WorkSignal = RealInput()
  "Electrical power drawn [W]"
  y = RealOutput()
end
